<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico sets 400 mln pesos in repos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico sets 400 mln pesos in repos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico purchased 400 million pesos in government paper from the secondary market on Tuesday through repurchase agreements, dealers said.</p>
<p>The agreements were settled as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    200 million    16 days  23.00 pct</p>
<p>    200 million    16 days  23.91 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
